 src/features/tmux-subagent/grid-planning.ts   | 20 ++++-
 .../tmux-subagent/pane-split-availability.ts  |  4 +-
 .../tmux-subagent/spawn-action-decider.ts     |  7 +-
 .../tmux-subagent/spawn-target-finder.ts      | 11 ++-
 5 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

